<div class="modal-dialog">
<div class="modal-content">
	<div class="modal-header">
		<button type="button" class="close" ng-click="dismiss()">&times;</button>
		<h4 class="modal-title">Test Account</h4>
	</div>
	<div class="modal-body">
		<p>
			You are about to create a new email account. DeskPRO will immediately connect and begin to download
			and process messages in the acccount.
		</p>
		<p ng-if="message_count !== null">
			When you performed the account "Test" a moment ago, the system detected {{ ng_var('message_count') }}
			messages exist in this account. These {{ ng_var('message_count') }} messages will be processed into tickets.
		</p>
		<p ng-if="message_count === null">
			Any messages that exist in this account will be processed into messages. For example, if the account has 1000
			messags you have not deleted, DeskPRO will begin processing all 1000 messages. You should use the "Test" feature
			on this page to verify how many messages exist in the account before proceeding.
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="modal-footer">
		<div ng-hide="is_testing">
			<button class="btn btn-default" ng-click="dismiss()">Cancel</button>
			<button class="btn btn-success" ng-click="confirm()">Save Account &amp; Begin Processing &rarr;</button>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
</div>